{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The River of Time has dried up, plunging parallel worlds into chaos. True spirits that stirred ripples in the river have been resurrected, entering a realm governed by bizarre rules. A great calamity has arisen, and the path to transcendence has appeared.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Pet System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 720 types of monsters and mythical beasts await in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to obtain Pet Eggs\u2014every monster, including bosses, can be tamed as a pet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Gem System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various gems and socket them into equipment to boost combat power.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Equipment System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm materials by defeating monsters and craft powerful gear using collected resources.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Skill System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot a diverse array of skills from monsters, with over 240 skill combinations to customize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Quest System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in engaging storylines through the game's quest system.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Teleportation System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly teleport to any map anytime, anywhere for convenient AFK monster grinding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7. AFK System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy hands-free gameplay with the AFK feature\u2014grind for equipment effortlessly while away from your screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8. Boss Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter powerful bosses randomly in the wild. Defeat them to claim rare and valuable loot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9. Auto-Loot</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically collect valuable items dropped by monsters during your adventures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10. Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK mode, adjustable sound settings, auto-equipment selection, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our QQ Group: 339510891</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u575a\u97e7\u9ed1\u94c1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/68d014f4e4871fb2efb08a80e4a94684a907c5c8.jpg"},{"name":"\u5014\u5f3a\u9752\u94dc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/bb22547020bc0045daf4f17b07818c948a778d69.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e0d\u5c48\u767d\u94f6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/ab3a60fff03a3de15ae18870245fb27dc276a689.jpg"},{"name":"\u8363\u8000\u9ec4\u91d1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/16965b0ab190beacbbc38d18c5018600d4c76c70.jpg"},{"name":"\u534e\u8d35\u94c2\u91d1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/37398660f1bb5426d9296ad138b9e8253772a9dc.jpg"},{"name":"\u7480\u74a8\u94bb\u77f3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/8f27bffa7b91eeba3239c24ee1cb82693a301857.jpg"},{"name":"\u8d85\u51e1\u5927\u5e08","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/6d0003cff16480854495395b8c3204852cc845e5.jpg"},{"name":"\u50b2\u4e16\u5b97\u5e08","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910720/38abebf18531fc0bd04500491fbbd610230030d6.jpg"},{"name":"\u5dc5\u5cf0\u738b\u8005","